WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,050
Two live rabbits for six yuan

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:04,550
One hundred pounds of vegetables

3
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,550
Three hundred catties of grain, three hundred

4
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:09,550
Pumpkins, potatoes, sweet potatoes, one hundred and fifty pounds, one hundred and two pounds

5
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:13,700
A total of one thousand six hundred and forty-five yuan

6
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:25,690
There are not many wild fruits found in the mountains.

7
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:28,690
Section Chief Gao will see if the leadership needs it.

8
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:31,260
Fruit is rarer than meat these days

9
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:33,760
