10
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:38,570
There is something so fresh this season

11
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:40,070
How much can be done

12
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:43,580
About a few hundred pounds

13
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,080
I'll take the sample to show to the boss tomorrow

14
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:46,080
little brother

15
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:48,780
I really found a treasure in your thread.

16
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:58,920
I'll continue to deliver it next time when it's in stock.

17
00:00:58,920 --> 00:00:59,920
Brother Qin
